# Self-Paced Learning in Civil E.T.

**Authors:** Sharples, Kent

## Abstract
Briefly reports on the structure and evaluation of an individually-paced, two year civil engineering technology curriculum sponsored by a National Science Foundation grant. The written modules progress linearly with support media presentations. Students in the self-paced program generally outperformed lecture-based students on cognitive achievement. (MA)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ179702

